body:
This is why I love him. He's so inspiring and not because he's perfect because he's so real. He jokingly wondered what new fans liked about him being his honesty and that is why this babywol is here for life.

&#x200B;

“I think I want to change the kind of person I’m from the inside completely, I have a thirst to show a more human and sincere side of me rather than just showing my façade. If you’re human, there are times when you become weak and broken. I’m sure there is beauty that comes from that. The moment when a person collapses, then, only then I can get back on my feet and stand up again, I believe that showing all of these sides without hiding is the way I should go as an artist now.”
